# Markdown markers and link syntax are hidden in navigate mode and shown raw while editing.
file <<END
# Weekly review
- Read **important** doc at [the wiki](https://wiki.example.com/x) and `cargo test`
END
see Weekly review
hide # Weekly
see - Read important doc at the wiki and cargo test
keys j <Enter>
see - Read **important** doc at [the wiki](https://wiki.example.com/x) and `cargo test`
keys <Up>
see # Weekly review
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
# Weekly review
